  "root": "Hyy",
  "arabic": "حيي",
  "root_idea": {
    "summary": "The root has two principal orientations: life and vitality, opposed to death; and shame or modest restraint, opposed to shamelessness.",
    "development": "The life branch extends to growth, sensation, intellect, enduring life, revival, and greetings originally phrased as prayers for life. The other branch concerns shrinking from what is improper, shame, and refraining.",
